  contentsAnswer: Camera stabilizer and its battery. Twelve hours shooting a wedding.
    I am done.
  weightAnswer: A little under nine kilos, including the case.
  metalAnswer: Frame, camera and battery. Some metal, plenty of padding.
  packingAnswer: Wait, the power light was still on. And I forgot the travel lock.
  responseAnswer: The motors try to correct a push. That is my fault; it should have
    been switched off.
